  "scientific_distinctions": [
    "Five Cellpose checkpoints and the morphology-pseudo-label-trained TinyMorphCNN checkpoint are identified as manuscript analysis checkpoints.",
    "The three reviewed TinyMorphCNN candidates are successive development runs and did not replace the treatment-analysis checkpoint.",
    "The four saved scikit-learn candidates were fitted to all 203 human-reviewed cells from 15 animals. They are not serialized held-out fold models and are not the fixed unsupervised morphometric comparator.",
    "Held-out benchmark results are represented by saved out-of-fold prediction records and validation design records. No serialized inner or outer cross-validation fold checkpoints were found.",
    "Publishing the saved candidates does not change the manuscript treatment analyses or establish direct validation of TinyMorphCNN by the separate morphometry/DINOv2 benchmark."
  ],
